# Evaitec Logo Variations

Following our design strategy, I have generated three premium logo variations that blend AI technology with organic growth elements.

````carousel
![Bio-Digital Infinity](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e891f36b-1a20-4d85-8b8c-7f3a65cecc50/evaitec_logo_v1_infinity_1774314895163.png)
**Variation 1: Bio-Digital Infinity**
A high-end 3D glassmorphic logo featuring a fusion of organic vines and digital circuits forming an infinity symbol. Represents continuous growth and technological evolution.
<!-- slide -->
![Core @i Microchip](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e891f36b-1a20-4d85-8b8c-7f3a65cecc50/evaitec_logo_v2_microchip_1774314911070.png)
**Variation 2: Core @i Microchip**
Focuses on the central "@i" brand element within a futuristic 3D microchip. Organic leaves grow out of the technical structure, emphasizing the "Intelligence" and "Life" aspects of the brand.
<!-- slide -->
![Minimalist Corporate](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e891f36b-1a20-4d85-8b8c-7f3a65cecc50/evaitec_logo_v3_minimalist_1774314924966.png)
**Variation 3: Minimalist Corporate**
A clean, abstract representation using premium materials and a professional color palette. Ideal for high-level corporate branding and consultancy.
````

## Design Decisions
- **Glassmorphism**: All variations use 3D depth and frosted glass effects to feel premium and state-of-the-art.
- **Color Palette**: I used the Deep Navy, Mint Green, and Electric Teal palette extracted from your previous work.
- **Typography**: Professional sans-serif with balanced weights to create a high-end tech feel.

Please let me know which direction you prefer, or if you'd like any specific refinements!
